The catalog (catalog.json and the files in sources/) and the scripts are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

This repository contains no religious texts, only links to them. Each text is published by its
own source (Project Gutenberg, eBible.org, the Tanzil Project, the Internet Archive) under the
terms given in its catalog entry's "license" field.
